  "_injected_text": "Text a harness or another AI puts into a chat that nobody typed (one AI session relaying words into another, \"From <someone>'s <AI> session: ...\", included). Each row: a pattern matched against the start (or the whole) of one text part, and kept_as, the speaker the words are kept under when they reach Trillion anyway (src/not-the-person.mjs at the /inbound door): peer for another AI's message, generated context for anything a program wrote. This hook drops every matching part; the door keeps a whole message that matches under its kept_as and opens no decision for it. Adding a shape is a row here.",
  "injected_text": [
    {
      "kept_as": "generated context",
      "pattern": "^\\s*<(system-reminder|trillion-message|environment_context|codex_internal_context|codex_delegation|codex_app\\.send_message_to_thread|heartbeat|hook_prompt(?=\\s+hook_run_id=)|user_instructions|skills_instructions|recommended_plugins|permissions instructions|collaboration_mode|INSTRUCTIONS|task-notification|local-command-caveat|local-command-stdout|local-command-stderr|bash-stdout|bash-stderr|turn_aborted|user_shell_command|subagent_notification|channel)\\b"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "peer",
      "pattern": "^\\s*<(agent-message|teammate-message|cross-session-message)\\b"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "peer",
      "pattern": "^\\s*From [^\\n]{0,60}?\\b(?:AI|Claude|Codex|ChatGPT|GPT|Gemini|agent|assistant)\\b[^\\n]{0,30}?\\b(?:session|orchestrator)\\b"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "peer",
      "pattern": "^\\s*Another Claude session sent a message:\\s*<(teammate-message|cross-session-message|agent-message)\\b"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "generated context",
      "pattern": "^\\s*# AGENTS\\.md instructions\\b"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "generated context",
      "pattern": "^\\s*\\[Request interrupted by user"
    },
    {
      "kept_as": "generated context",
      "pattern": "^\\s*\\[Image: source: "
    }
  ],
